  "contentHtml": "<p>늘 도움주시는 여러 선생님들 감사합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1학기에 김신연 선생님의 도움을 너무나 크게 받아서 감사히 잘 사용했었습니다.</p><p>2학기는 진도가 달라서....</p><p>부족하지만.. 김신연 선생님의 자료를 바탕으로 ppt를 만들어 보았습니다.</p><p>기존의 틀에 내용만 바꾼 수준이지만... ^^;;;</p><p>여기에서 늘 도움만 받아서, 부끄럽지만 올립니다^^</p><p>ppt 중간의 동영상 필요하신 분들 아래 링크타고 다운받으시면 됩니다.</p><p>비상교과서 dvd 영상입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>폰트-배달의민족도현체</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76d516c2296168f8c8ecaf68bf6b55c1c7d34cb1?download\" data-file-name=\"16차시_1-1.순물질과혼합물.show\" data-file-size=\"4667683\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansoftshow\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D540%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20201012095324&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F76d516c2296168f8c8ecaf68bf6b55c1c7d34cb1')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">16차시_1-1</span><span class=\"type\">.순물질과혼합물</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.45MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18JMXQ2D0mjDhoZDPcsFBdTSXVzFENiU3?usp=sharing\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18JMXQ2D0mjDhoZDPcsFBdTSXVzFENiU3?usp=sharing</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"16차시_1-1.순물질과혼합물 - Google 드라이브\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"drive.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18JMXQ2D0mjDhoZDPcsFBdTSXVzFENiU3?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18JMXQ2D0mjDhoZDPcsFBdTSXVzFENiU3?usp=sharing\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18JMXQ2D0mjDhoZDPcsFBdTSXVzFENiU3?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18JMXQ2D0mjDhoZDPcsFBdTSXVzFENiU3?usp=sharing\"><div class=\"og-image